Z||000000||chrissherman||12-17-2000||03:25 PM||||HI All.Will an 84 fiero head fit and work on a 82 buick block? the only diff I see is a realy small oil filter.And prong's on the coil.I am trading my 88 taurus for an 84se 4cyl 4 speed from a body shop.Not a wrecked car!The owner bought the car for his daughter It was for her graduation but she wanted a toyota instead,cool for MEEE.But I wish that the plugs was left in it for the last 5 years. Still no movment after a week and a hafe of soaking.The owner has a motor out of an 82 buick siting on the hood on the buick? for me to see and to get motivated.I think It is an incentive to get the Fiero off the lot<BR>P.S.S The motor has a fule pump on the block?? and a heat tube/rail on the head that is blocked off THANKS ALOT CHRIS<BR>[This message has been edited by chrissherman (edited 12-17-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by chrissherman (edited 12-18-2000).]||||reg||1
